# Aegis patch 189 - sync-crash fix, dock behavior, error-page split, UI trims
# 2026-11-27 wave from the r145 field reports:
#   1. crash 1795784411305: "Native method not present" right after Aegis ID
#      re-login - the sync merge calls PasswordStoreBridge JNI whose
#      registration table went stale in a banked build. Fix: fail-soft merge
#      + force JNI registration regeneration (file touch) + the bridge will
#      re-register on this build.
#   2. dock auto-hid on the new tab / Aegis home (r145 report) - hold it.
#   3. new tab from the tab grid arrived with the dock still collapsed.
#   4. dock search had no recommendations - open tabs + famous places now.
#   5. dock URL pill opened in caret mode - select-all instead, pencil row
#      switches back to editing (r145 report).
#   6. "Automatically open tab groups from other devices" still shown
#      although there is no Google sync backend - remove the row.
#   7. notification permission rationale dialog filled the whole screen -
#      compact layout, stays anchored to the bottom.
#   8. every net error showed the "You're offline" hero - gate it on
#      upstream's html.offline classification so site-side errors show the
#      real error page.

